## Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev` testing.
## In production these are set via `wrangler secret put <NAME>`, never committed.

GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
RESEND_API_KEY=your-resend-api-key-here
POSTHOG_API_KEY=your-posthog-project-api-key-here
ADMIN_SECRET=pick-a-long-random-string-here

## Salt for one-way hashing the sender's email before it ever reaches PostHog —
## see src/analytics.ts hashSenderEmail(). Never log or commit the real value.
## Generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`. Also set live in production via
## `wrangler secret put SENDER_HASH_SALT` (2026-09-14).
SENDER_HASH_SALT=pick-a-long-random-hex-string-here

## Comma-separated list of sender addresses Ian uses for testing, checked
## BEFORE hashing so is_test_sender can be computed without ever storing a
## real address (src/analytics.ts isTestSender()). Defaults to MY_EMAIL if
## unset. Also set live in production via `wrangler secret put
## TEST_SENDER_EMAILS` (2026-09-14).
TEST_SENDER_EMAILS=iansagabaen@gmail.com
